      "comment": "LITTLE SNITCH (2) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.75 lengths away in second (23.07) behind Sue's Memory at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Top prospect. NOVOCASTRIAN (3) is a handily bred pup making his debut without a trial. Expected to feature on debut. TRALEE MAVERICK (1) comes off an average run last start when fourth at Taree Super Track over 300m behind Herugrim (17.85). A forward showing wouldn't surprise. JAMIE GIRL (5) showed some ability on debut here and is given another chance. Can feature with the right run.",
